THIRD-PARTY CODE

Betaflight (https://github.com/betaflight/betaflight), GPL-3.0-or-later.
sim-core compiles unmodified Betaflight 4.5.1 sources into its WebAssembly
module. Any change to Betaflight is carried as a patch file in this
repository, never as an edit to the Betaflight tree.

PORTED FROM QUADMATH

The fly harness's radio code (tests/browser/fly-radio.mjs: radio presets,
the axis map and the stick calibration wizard) is ported from quadmath's
sim (sim-touch.js, repository ryanroths/quadmath) by its owner's decision of
2026-10-24, and is GPL-3.0-or-later here like the rest of this repository.

REFERENCE, NOT SOURCE

WebFPVSimulator (https://github.com/Mathew-Harvey/WebFPVSimulator), GPLv3, is
used as a reference. Its code may be read; none of it is copied into this
repository. Its published WebAssembly module is used only as a black-box
comparison in tests, run from a separate local clone.

OPEN LICENSING QUESTION (deferred to a lawyer; nothing here blocks on it)

The quadmath site's sim.html (repository ryanroths/quadmath) is not part of
this repository. It will load the sim-core WebAssembly module and its JS
wrapper at runtime. Whether that makes sim.html, or other quadmath site code,
subject to the GPL is an open question for legal advice. Until it is
answered, sim-core stays a separate GPLv3 repository with public source, and
this notice records the question.
